Key settings that affect behavior:
trading:  enable_auto_trading: true  # Enable/disable auto trading  live_mode: true            # true = live data, false = historical  backtest:  enabled: false             # Set to true to run backtest mode


Summary
Script	Use Case	Mode
run_live_bot.py	Production live trading	Continuous loop
run_trading_system.py	Testing/debugging	One-time run




 Summary of Changes
1. ML model integration
Added _run_ml_models() to TradingEngine to run:
Daily VOMC (probability and signal)
Intraday VOMC (probability and signal)
RL Agent (action)
Daily return prediction (XGBoost)
Intraday return prediction (XGBoost)
Regime detection (HMM)
2. Model estimates in results
Added model_estimates to the analysis results dictionary
Includes probabilities, signals, predictions, and RL actions
3. Display in result table
Added 5 new columns:
D-VOMC Prob: Daily VOMC probability (color-coded: green ≥60%, red ≤40%, yellow otherwise)
I-VOMC Prob: Intraday VOMC probability (same color coding)
RL Action: RL agent action (BUY/SELL/HOLD with colors)
D-Ret Pred: Daily return prediction (green if positive, red if negative)
I-Ret Pred: Intraday return prediction (green if positive, red if negative)
4. Data preparation
Updated DataLoader to calculate daily_return and return columns required by ML models
Table Layout
The result table now shows:
Symbol | LTP | Signal | [Entry Indicators] | │ | [Exit Indicators] | │ | D-VOMC Prob | I-VOMC Prob | RL Action | D-Ret Pred | I-Ret Pred | Agree% | Position | ...
Model Estimates Displayed
Daily VOMC Probability: Probability of upward movement (0-100%)
Intraday VOMC Probability: Intraday probability of upward movement
RL Agent Action: Reinforcement learning agent's decision (BUY/SELL/HOLD)
Daily Return Prediction: Predicted daily return from XGBoost model
Intraday Return Prediction: Predicted intraday return from XGBoost model
When you run the bot, you'll see the model estimates in the result table, showing what each ML model is predicting for each symbol.